{"uid":"1b2348b5226986d2","name":"test_spec_and_cli_docs_key_cache_reuse_on_transcript_identity_not_size","fullName":"tests.test_hub_real_render_cap_whole_call#test_spec_and_cli_docs_key_cache_reuse_on_transcript_identity_not_size","historyId":"9a6109b9e9ec0c32a2cb4afea8a0c551","time":{"start":1792071928099,"stop":1792071928102,"duration":3},"description":"Task cure-01-02-3 retry (C.4, D.1; DoD 3): the hub's absent-index\n    cache is keyed on each iteration's full transcript identity\n    `(inode, size, mtime_ns, ctime_ns)` (`_absent_index_cache_get`), so a\n    same-size rewrite or replacement invalidates that iteration's entry and\n    is rescanned. SPEC.md §11.4 and docs/cli.md must say reuse needs an\n    unchanged transcript identity, never merely the same transcript size,\n    and must scope invalidation to the one changed iteration.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task cure-01-02-3 retry (C.4, D.1; DoD 3): the hub's absent-index<br />\ncache is keyed on each iteration's full transcript identity<br />\n<code>(inode, size, mtime_ns, ctime_ns)</code> (<code>_absent_index_cache_get</code>), so a<br />\nsame-size rewrite or replacement invalidates that iteration's entry and<br />\nis rescanned. SPEC.md §11.4 and docs/cli.md must say reuse needs an<br />\nunchanged transcript identity, never merely the same transcript size,<br />\nand must scope invalidation to the one changed iteration.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1792071797339,"stop":1792071797339,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1792071797339,"stop":1792071797339,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":fa